<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Budget Planner</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <section class="hero">
        <a href="/" class="hero-brand">budget<span>.</span></a>
        <h1>Tine-ti banii sub control, <em>fara stres</em>.</h1>
        <p>Planifica bugetul lunar, urmareste cheltuielile si vezi unde-ti pleaca banii — simplu si clar.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <% if (user) { %>
                <a href="/budget" class="btn-dark-custom">Deschide dashboard</a>
            <% } else { %>
                <a href="/register" class="btn-dark-custom">Incepe gratuit</a>
                <a href="/login" class="btn-outline-custom">Autentificare</a>
            <% } %>
        </div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
